# golden-test dumps (PHI: real de-identified prompts / timelines / image hashes).
# The harness writes under the config results_dir (su-vista mount, outside the repo),
# but this glob is a defensive backstop against an --out that points inside the tree.
*_golden.jsonl
*_golden.meta.json
golden/

# config-context viewer output (PHI: real de-identified prompts / timelines / imagery).
# Same posture as the golden dumps above — written under results_dir (su-vista mount);
# this glob is the defensive backstop against an --out that points inside the tree.
*_context_view.html
context_view/
